## Objective
- Conduct passive reconnaissance and vulnerability assessment against Spare's in-scope API surface (`api.sparelabs.com`, `platform.sparelabs.com`, `forms.sparelabs.com`, `routing.sparelabs.com`, `spare.com`) for bug bounty reporting.
