- **Evidence rebuild:** Canonical hashes in KB enable byte-exact evidence regeneration from fresh captures (~7 requests, ≤1 rps)
- **UAT fleet parity LOST:** `api.uat.sparelabs.com` now returns 401 on all routes; dropped from fleet-parity matrix
